together and we set this room on fire Climbed out

04:41.011 --> 04:44.774
of the ashes and we rose above the wire Now the

04:44.854 --> 04:49.356
house lights hum across the floor In these empty

04:49.416 --> 04:52.538
arenas We're not afraid anymore

